# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# Oral history source material — text + audio are personal interview
# content and not redistributed with the code. Drop your own files in
# `oralhistory/` locally; the directory exists via .gitkeep.
oralhistory/*
!oralhistory/.gitkeep
!oralhistory/README.md

# Memory / state directories that should never be committed
**/whisper_cache/
settings.json
